      "text": "# TRU FORD\n\nFM 21-76 water crossings. Look from high ground. Cross where the river breaks into channels, upstream of a sandbar, on a course that meets the current at about 45 degrees. Pole about 7.5 centimeters by 2.1 to 2.4 meters, planted upstream. A raft is a gap.\n"
